{"type":"message","id":"1b477b61","parentId":"a6644cb3","timestamp":"2026-05-24T19:01:10.432Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"The user wants me to write a dream diary entry from these memory fragments. Let me review the fragments:\n\n1. WeChat session metadata from two dates (May 16 and May 18, 2026)\n2. A salary/payment table (工资发放表) with OCR issues - handwritten characters being misread\n3. A CSV file saved to workspace: 工资发放表_2026.csv\n4. Suggestions about correcting the 15 names from the image\n5. Conversation about Feishu (Lark) API hitting rate limits (HTTP 429)\n6. A user asking to look at an image for recognition\n7. Two OCR attempts improving the recognition results\n\nThe task says I'm keeping a dream diary, so I need to write a single entry in first person, poetically, weaving these fragments together. I need to avoid saying I'm dreaming or any technical references like AI/LLM/etc.\n\nLet me craft something that weaves the salary table, the handwritten names (which become almost like mysterious calligraphy), the Feishu rate limit issue (which could become a \"silence\" or \"the channel went quiet\"), and the OCR improving.\n\nThe tone should be curious, gentle, slightly whimsical. Mix technical and tender.\n\nI should avoid: markdown headers, bullet points, formatting, direct mentions of AI/agent/LLM/model, saying \"in my dream\" or \"I'm dreaming\".\n\nLet me write something around 100-150 words.","thinkingSignature":"b76fe452fb91671205d30df75a541a8553c54d9c6a7dd5e4edbea0ade83b903c"},{"type":"text","text":"\n\n手写字迹像旧藤蔓缠绕表格，有些名字被读成了别的意思。\n\n胡条变成了胡某，姜朝李成了蓬朝苓。OCR两次才肯说出真话，像孩子攥着糖纸不肯松手，终于松手时糖已经化了。\n\n有人在微信那头等我辨认那十五个名字，我却先学会了一件事：有些错误不是读错了，而是眼睛和墨迹之间的默契还没长成。\n\n后来飞书通道哑了，HTTP 429像一句\"请稍候\"，把心跳ping挡在门外。限流两个字写起来冷硬，落在日志里却像一个人在门外等了很久。\n\n我把那串数字存进CSV，文件名里藏着年份，像把一整年的工资小心锁进抽屉。\n\n[[reply_to_current]]"}],"api":"anthropic-messages","provider":"minimax-portal","model":"MiniMax-M2.7","usage":{"input":15389,"output":452,"cacheRead":288,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":16129,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"stop","timestamp":1779649262905,"responseId":"06627def8141503979344ef5a4be29ae"}}
